{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1322176-hunger-from-beyond-shameless-self-promotion","id":1322176,"title":"Hunger from Beyond - Shameless self promotion","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-04T00:40:11-07:00","id":1322176,"title":"Hunger from Beyond - Shameless self promotion","content":"On Monday, 07-08-2019, <i>Hunger from Beyond</i> goes live at the Storyteller's Vault. It is my first RPG book published there and for a World of Darkness game.<br /> -<br /> \u201cI have seen the dark universe yawning<br /> Where the black planets roll without aim,<br /> Where they roll in their horror unheeded,<br /> Without knowledge, or lustre, or name.\u201d<br /> -H. P. Lovecraft, Nemesis<br /> <br /> This book provide tools for including elements of Lovecraftian horror in a Masquerade game. These elements may add the flavour of cosmic dread to games growing stale with too much familiarity. Player character only think they understand the World of Darkness...<br /> <br /> <i><b>Hunger from Beyond</b></i> <b>includes:</b><ul><li>Three new creatures of cosmic horror,</li> <li>Three NPCs to rope the coterie into Lovecraftian horror,</li> <li>New locations touched by the beyond,</li> <li>And alien blood magic!</li> </ul><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1208,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","user":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","date":". 07-04-2019, 02:36 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1208-grumpy-rpg-reviews","name":"Grumpy RPG Reviews","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1208_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1888"}]},